        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Equivalência com a versão Azure&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Container Apps → ECS Fargate + ALB · Container Apps Job → ECS run-task · PostgreSQL Flexible → RDS&lt;br&gt;Azure Managed Redis → ElastiCache · Blob Storage → S3 · ACR → ECR · Log Analytics → CloudWatch&lt;br&gt;Secrets do Container App → SSM Parameter Store · Managed Identity / federated credential → IAM roles / OIDC&lt;br&gt;Sem NAT Gateway (custo): tasks em subnets públicas, com ingresso só a partir do ALB." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#333333;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="1190" width="1000" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
